Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:04.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If there is a god of cosplay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.46,0:00:07.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make her...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,...smile upon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not going down like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.33,0:00:17.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when I finally get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you see me, Kai-sama?\NLook how cute I am now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:26.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone, look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:29.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems our lovely Liliel has\Nlit a fire in miss Nagomi's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's right...\NHer crowd just keeps growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:40.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,B-but so is Liliel's!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not happening quite as fast,\Nbut her crowd's getting bigger, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:22.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,403.2)}{\an7}My Enchanted Armor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This really is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You may not know this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Miss Liliel herself may not know this herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:38.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Many components contribute\Nto photographers forming a crowd:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.58,0:02:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,the character's popularity, the cosplayer's fame,\Nskimpiness, but there's skill to it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,And if photographers stay in the crowd,\Nthen the crowd will continue to grow, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, that is kinda obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The trick, then, is to never let\Na photographer want to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.21,0:03:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're still here?\NYou were here when she started.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but like...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,She just keeps them coming.\NI don't know when to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look! Another good pose! She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Liliel's strength is her massive\Ninventory of poses and expressions!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's hard to come up with poses on the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Most newbies might have\Nfive to ten poses in their repertoire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But look at our Liliel...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough time for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I should do a pose from that one scene!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep going. I've only got...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,...a thousand more poses to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.29,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,57.6)}{\an7}WHOOOOOAAA!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's from that famous cover art!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.33,0:03:46.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Liliel can faithfully reproduce\Nscenes from the manga and anime!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.96,0:03:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that means she doesn't need\Nto come up with poses on the fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Between the anime, the spinoff, and the manga,\Nthere are tons of scenes to pick from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:58.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And Ririsa has them all memorized!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This moment was a huge deal in the manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want everyone to see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:06.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.08,0:04:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on the Queens\NI didn't notice she was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It just keeps going...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Miss Liliel has a unique skill...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The skill to keep photographers glued to their spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:20.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I may need to get some photos of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.42,0:04:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going in, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So many people are here to see my cosplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.33,0:04:38.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's nerve-wracking.\NAnd scary, too, with all the flashes going off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:43.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love this so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've worked so hard on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now I know it wasn't a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nagomi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You helped me realize something truly important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You love Liliel, and cosplay is how you show that love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.21,0:05:10.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here's how I would respond now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:13.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay might just be the way I show my love for Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:16.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might only be cosplaying because of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was a nerdy otaku who liked sexy outfits.\NI always kept that to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.79,0:05:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But cosplay gave me a place that accepted me,\Nwhere I felt safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,It gave me the courage to be myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.96,0:05:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which sounds weird,\Nbecause it lets me transform into someone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay is like my enchanted armor\Nthat transforms me into my true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.29,0:05:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's kinda nerdy, but that's how I'd put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the answer I would give you now, Nagomi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:06:02.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wrote you off as just another passionate newbie,\Nbut I was wrong, Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.17,0:06:05.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:08.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yet weirdly, I don't feel the usual anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:11.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's 'cause I remembered how I felt starting off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:13.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never felt this comfortable\Naround another cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's something different about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:26.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Competing with Mayura was fun.\NIt got my blood pumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:32.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Competing with you feels good, Liliel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It feels like we shine brighter together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I could feel this way about a rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait. Did I just call you a rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.79,0:06:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll be rivals soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard there were two Queens here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, Mayura-sama left already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?! Then what's this crowd next to Nagomi's?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Some new girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,This awesome newbie!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who is she? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno, but who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:08.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a really cute Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is crazy, bro.\NYou only see this kinda excitement at Comiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.71,0:07:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't you need to get pictures of your client?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I gotta get pictures of the venue, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:42.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:47.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,People were hype about seeing Nagomi and Mayura,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they're still just as hype for this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.00,0:07:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make her famous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:53.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make her go viral!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That Liliel cosplayer could be the next Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.67,0:08:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish this moment could last forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,But it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:09.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got to be a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This was a fantastic event.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,...Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san, I know you just said\Nyou weren't acting like a real professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,THIS is the cosplayer I wanted\Nto work with so badly back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.88,0:08:47.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:53.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.46,0:08:56.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.29,0:09:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've already been working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay Stream 55 will be closing soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.33,Q3,,0,0,0,,Cosplayers, please head to the changing rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.42,0:09:08.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:10.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,Cosplayers, please head to the changing rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.46,0:09:16.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay, I'm gonna go...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.63,0:09:18.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, Liliel-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.75,0:09:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I send you my pics?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you have a card or socials?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,My eyes hurt and my makeup is dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.29,0:09:26.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I stop to talk,\NLiliel's gonna fall apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She disappeared on us once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:35.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is she, Cinderella?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eh, it's okay.\NIt doesn't matter who she is, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's left us with her glass slipper:\Nsome great photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.21,0:09:48.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, you're so cool, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.63,0:09:50.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.13,0:09:57.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.75,0:09:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got some great pics of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Li... Lili...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.92,0:10:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.21,0:10:07.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh... you're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad it went okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,when I saw your face,\NI felt so relieved...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.58,0:10:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, but I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.04,0:10:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry! I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.50,0:10:27.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about what happened earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remember, in manga,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.33,0:10:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,the protagonist always finds\Ntheir way out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Today you were the main character of that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were awesome out there, Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.88,Q3,,0,0,0,,Thank you... Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess my work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.88,0:10:55.96,Q4,,0,0,0,,Thank you... Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't believe I got to cosplay again...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.79,0:11:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.71,0:11:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:16.17,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,165.6)}{\an7}DIVINE GUT BUSTER
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:16.54,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,165.6)}{\an7}DIVINE GUT BUSTER
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:16.54,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.6,561.6)}{\an7}Dash
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.71,0:11:22.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You still always react by blocking low.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That dashing mid attack is so OP...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why did you ghost everyone, idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say you were quitting?\NWhy didn't you say you were coming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I didn't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:37.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You didn't need to throw it\Nall away like that, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep calling me stupid?!\NYou were so nice to me on the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because we're friends, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if you stop cosplaying,\Nit's still the thing that brought us together!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.21,0:11:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,All those experiences,\Nthe good times, the friendship, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.46,0:12:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't like Lustalotte! I liked you, Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.67,0:12:06.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay might've been everything to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But don't throw away everything else, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.92,0:12:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eri... I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then... Thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.00,0:12:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No. Don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.21,0:12:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:29.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:36.33,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,201.6)}{\an7}Changing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.54,0:12:36.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,H-hey, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.33,0:12:41.67,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(793.6,57.6)}{\an7}HUFF HUFF HUFF
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.21,0:12:39.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can finally see the amazing details in your costume!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You look JUST like Icola-chan!\NYou're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:44.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,316.8)}{\an7}DODODO
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.67,0:12:43.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is this embroidered?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.63,Q10,,0,0,0,,A-And I can see how goddamn adorable she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is this embroidered?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:46.54,Q10,,0,0,0,,A-And I can see how goddamn adorable she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.63,0:12:46.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this fabric at the store!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.58,Q10,,0,0,0,,A-And I can see how goddamn adorable she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's got some glitter to it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:48.96,Q10,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's got some glitter to it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:51.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd you pick her Chaos Form?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love that version of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,She almost went evil trying to get strong,\Nbut right when she was on the edge,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,she came back in that new form, like,\Nit was such an emotional moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.92,0:13:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know, right?!\NEvery week I was so worried about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.71,0:13:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But then she got super powerful and came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:14.63,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.2,374.4)}{\an7}GRRRRR
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:08.75,Q10,,0,0,0,,OMG! Talking with her is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,But then she got super powerful and came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:10.00,Q10,,0,0,0,,OMG! Talking with her is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.75,0:13:10.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,The relief after all that tension was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.08,Q10,,0,0,0,,I hated her so much before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The relief after all that tension was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.08,0:13:12.08,Q10,,0,0,0,,I hated her so much before, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.67,Q10,,0,0,0,,But how can I?! She's a nerd like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw, man... I wish I could've gotten a picture of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to get a picture of you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gimme your number, I'll text it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-okay! Yay, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:32.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah. This feels right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love cosplayers. We're all in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She and I are totally gonna be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Liliel! Can I meet you by the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Sorry, I'll go get changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,K.... Ka, Kai...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:50.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:50.46,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.2,374.4)}{\an7}Bow...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.79,0:13:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is he your, uh... p-photographer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:58.42,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,57.6)}{\an7}I TAKE THAT BACK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:14:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Grow up, Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know what you have to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! Do you wanna cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.13,0:14:10.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love new cosplayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,We could do a Prince Charming group!\NYou could be Kai-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.08,0:14:18.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, uh, c-can I have your... Your number?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.58,0:14:23.63,Q14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,108)}{\an7}Women's Changing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, s-sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,YAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feeling hot, huh? You got water?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:28.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, I brought some!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's a canteen girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn, that crowd you had was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:39.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're definitely gonna be famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:40.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,How'd it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:44.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, it was so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:48.67,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(793.6,165.6)}{\an7}SHE'S SO PRECIOUS
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.83,0:14:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please stay this way forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Eh? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.33,0:14:59.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We only had our prep room booked till a certain time,\Nso we can't use it anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, but could you go\Nchange in the public changing room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who messed up the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.75,Q15,,0,0,0,,{\pos(524.8,295.2)}{\an7}I don't mean to judge,\N{\pos(371.2,345.6)}{\an7}but Nagomi's really not that great of a coslpayer.\N{\pos(435.2,568.8)}{\an7}Ugh, that bitch. I just pretend I don't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.38,0:15:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love everyone...\NBut they don't feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.42,0:15:39.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll just get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.33,0:15:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I forgot someone helped me get into this...\NAnd I can't reach the zipper!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should I call Saito to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:51.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I can't have someone come
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,in here just to help me change,\Nthat'd be so rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.75,0:15:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:59.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ignore the fact everyone's laughing at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.75,0:16:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your cosplay is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:16.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we get to talk to THE Nagomi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your Icola is so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.75,0:16:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were on this month's CosMedia, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right on the front cover! I had to get one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bought it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:29.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,...Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We love your work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.54,0:16:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought everyone hated me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I never though they'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right. I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:49.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been so focused on the horrible comments online.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I forgot that in real life,\Nno one has ever said anything mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,They've all been nothing but nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.96,0:16:58.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:05.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I lied all this time,\Nsaying how much I loved every cosplayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,How could I, when I never showed that love for myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And because I didn't like myself...\NI saw everyone as a potential enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:23.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone. I'm sorry, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.25,0:17:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm just so relieved to be done, it all came out.\NI'm totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:30.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was worried for a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.13,0:17:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The pressure on pros must be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:37.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Girl, you're not even a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love cosplayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:47.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:48.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nagomi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'd better be at Summer Comiket.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be there for work as the most\Npopular character of the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay! I'll be there as Liliel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.13,0:18:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's saying they want\Nto get pictures of you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is this from earlier? Wait, 50K shares?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sorry, should I have asked first?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.75,0:18:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I already uploaded a bunch with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:15.83,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,86.4)}{\an7}Don't know this cosplayer\N{\pos(128,136.8)}{\an7}but she's so freaking cute...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.75,0:18:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you surprised?\NYou saw the crowd around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sooner or later, you're gonna be famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That pressure you're feeling is a rite of passage.\NTry to enjoy it, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you ever forget the smile on your face today...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:38.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll return the favor and give\Nyou the reminder you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Figures she's exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:59.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Between the crowd of photographers,\Nand what happened with Sensei and Nagomi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad she had a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.04,0:19:08.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They probably think we're some cutesy couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.75,0:19:12.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd freak out if she were Liliel,\Nbut she's just Ririsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.92,0:19:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where are we? Did we miss our stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.25,0:19:26.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.63,0:19:30.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye out. You go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be there for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.96,0:19:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I have him. I don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whew, it's warm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:51.00,Q16,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,86.4)}{\an7}Cold, so she moved to\N{\pos(793.6,136.8)}{\an7}a warmer train car
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:20:00.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Promise you'll stay with me forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.83,0:20:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-o-oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:09.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-s-s-she's using the L word?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-Okumura! Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.46,0:20:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.29,0:20:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-sorry, I didn't mean to eavesdrop...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the two of you were so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.38,0:20:34.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We are! Especially after the great event\Nwe had with Liliel today!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of her for how perfectly she can\Nshow off her love for Liliel through cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.21,0:20:43.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please, it's all thanks to your\Ntremendous support, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the whole reason I can put\Nso much energy into cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:49.92,Q10,,0,0,0,,See?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.96,0:20:49.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You see?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We make the best partners!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.71,0:20:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, they meant something else.\NCosplayer and photographer, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Christ, though, do they see themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,See, this shot of Liliel came out so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:07.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It did! Great job, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.25,0:21:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are they sure they're not together?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, kids these days...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:17.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,...I don't get 'em one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.58,0:21:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know how the world at\Nlarge might think of cosplay,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.75,0:21:28.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,but they're putting their hearts into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And to do that,\Nthey need a club room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be their advisor and keep them on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.71,0:21:38.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, this isn't solely my decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:46.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,As for whether their activities meet the mark,\NI'll let our wonderful student council have their say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.46,0:21:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds about right...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.00,0:21:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about whether it's okay\Nto put this out for the other students to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:57.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,Dude, look at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Hanyuu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:58.38,Q3,,0,0,0,,Her tits are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:21:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Hanyuu-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:21:59.25,Q3,,0,0,0,,Her tits are huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:21:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's kept this a secret until now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's kept this a secret until now, right?
